Third-party services
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

ContentOS talks to services that are NOT covered by this license and that each
deployer must obtain and comply with independently: Meta/Instagram Graph API,
TikTok for Developers, YouTube Data API, Supabase, OpenRouter, Upstash, Langfuse,
Apify and OpusClip. You are responsible for your own API credentials, quotas,
platform review processes and terms of service.

